  "item_short_desc": "<p>Defend yourself against the toughest weather with the Spec Ops 3-in-1 Soft Shell Jacket. The tactical military jacket features a waterproof outer shell and a removable fleece liner. You can wear both layers together or separately as a windbreaker and a fleece jacket. As part of Rothco&rsquo;s rugged Soft Shell outerwear series, the high-performance jacket shields you from cold and wet weather. The Soft Shell waterproof 3-layer fabric system deflects wind, retains heat, and releases moisture.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "312",
  "description": "<p>Defend yourself against the toughest weather with the Spec Ops 3-in-1 Soft Shell Jacket. The tactical military jacket features a waterproof outer shell and a removable fleece liner. You can wear both layers together or separately as a windbreaker and a fleece jacket. As part of Rothco&rsquo;s rugged Soft Shell outerwear series, the high-performance jacket shields you from cold and wet weather. The Soft Shell waterproof 3-layer fabric system deflects wind, retains heat, and releases moisture. Warm &amp; Soft Fleece Liner: Made of 100% polyester fleece, the removable liner keeps your body warm and comfortable in a variety of environments as a standalone jacket or as an inner layer. The fleece jacket features a full-length zipper, its own loop hanger, along with 2 interior mesh drop pockets and 2 front zipper pockets for storing small everyday carry items like your cellphone and wallet. High-Capacity Storage: These tactical jackets feature a variety of pockets. The 2 shoulder zipper pockets and 2 chest zipper pockets each have an opening for wired headphones, where you can store and connect your audio device or phone inside. The outer shell consists of 2 interior zipper pockets and a left forearm utility pocket for small items, and a double zipper back pocket that&rsquo;s ideal for gloves and other cold weather accessories. Protection from the Elements: These winter coats also feature a removable stowaway hood that conveniently stores inside the collar, and is easily accessible when needed. The adjustable elastic wrist cuffs and drawstring waist help block the wind and cold weather while retaining your body temperature. Utility at the Forefront: The front full-length dual zipper allows you to open the jacket from both the top and bottom for quick and easy access to your items, while reinforced forearm yokes enhance the jacket&rsquo;s durability and performance. The zippered underarm vents provide additional ventilation and breathability when needed. Display your flag and morale patches on the 2 shoulder loop fields.</p>",
